    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d258-a2">

                <pb facs="0305" n="205" xml:id="pg205"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2—Telegram—Translation]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Association of Mexican Producers to President
                        Carranza</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-21"><hi rendition="#italic">January 21</hi> [<hi
                                rendition="#italic">22</hi>], <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >1920</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The petroleum producers have received your Excellency’s telegram dated January
                    20th and are appreciative of your prompt action in granting them the temporary
                    relief requested (stop) They will accordingly instruct their representatives to
                    proceed at once to petition for permits along the lines indicated in your
                    telegram.</p>
                <p>(Signed by the forty-six companies who signed telegram to Carranza dated Jan. 14,
                    1920).</p>
            </div>
        </body>
